---
import { getEntry, render } from 'astro:content';
import LegalLayout from '../layouts/LegalLayout.astro';

const policy = await getEntry('legal', 'privacy-policy');
if (!policy) throw new Error('Missing How-To-Use-AI.com privacy policy');
const { Content } = await render(policy);
---

<LegalLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="How-To-Use-AI.com privacy practices, data handling, service providers, retention, and privacy rights."
  canonicalPath="/privacy/"
>
  <Content />
  <section aria-labelledby="store-policy-note"><h2 id="store-policy-note">Book store access and delivery</h2><p>For direct purchases, the store records your verified email, purchased format, payment identifiers, amount, currency and order state. It stores hashed sign-in/session tokens and sends transactional access and order emails through MailerSend from hello@repasscloud.com. The email provider receives the recipient address and message content, including a short-lived sign-in link; click/open/content tracking is disabled. Sign-in links last fifteen minutes; browser sessions last seven days. Short-lived download links are checked against your purchase before private R2 files are streamed. Signed-copy orders additionally record the shipping name and address supplied at checkout. Use the contact page for purchase support or hello@repasscloud.com for replies and privacy enquiries.</p><p><a href="/downloads/">Open your book library</a></p></section>
</LegalLayout>
